content.text:
Proceeding. I updated the accepted foundation spec to require:

- fresh, root-bound workspace observation during validation;
- graph-private prepared execution inputs in the opaque capability;
- explicit Git trust evidence and rechecks under the release lock.

The existing graph WIP remains uncommitted until it satisfies those requirements.

